# PBR route debug view (lane PBRR1, docs/NIFSKOPE_PBR_RENDERER.md R1 "debug overlay").
#
# Tints every FO4 lighting- and effect-shader shape by the route its .pbrm
# resolved through (swap / nifx / direct / sibling / fo76 / stem / legacy), lit
# by N.L so the shape still reads. A data view, not a shading mode.
#
# No conditions: Renderer::setupProgram selects it by name while the View menu's
# "PBR Route View" (or the WW_PBRM_ROUTE_VIEW=1 pin) is on, the same way
# pbrm_default.prog is chosen. An empty condition list never matches the scan.

shaders fo4_default.vert pbr_route.frag
